# Rename this file on the SD card to /amun/config/self-test.flag to opt in.
#
# With no exact-title pack installed, AMUN will show a platform-only self-test for
# native 00040000 titles. It performs zero game-memory reads and no unlocks. It tests
# the monotonic clock, CTRPF menu/input delivery, and a temporary AMUN-owned ledger,
# then removes that scratch ledger. Remove self-test.flag when finished.
